1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed"

2
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:35,700
(EP3: The Night Someone Fell First)

3
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,239
Brother.

4
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,540
Where are you?

5
00:01:52,299 --> 00:01:53,040
Brother.

6
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,040
What are you doing?

7
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,540
Hiding someone here?

8
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,560
In the middle of the night?

9
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Who's showering?

10
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,319
No one.

11
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,039
OK.

12
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,180
I won't ask then.

13
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,360
Why are you here?

14
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,840
It's my brother's place.

15
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,520
I can come whenever I want.

16
00:02:18,939 --> 00:02:20,539
At this hour,

17
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,800
you're doing laundry?

18
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,000
There's a leak.

19
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:26,620
Brother.

20
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,400
I need to tell you something.

21
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,479
That night...

22
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:34,240
what did it mean to you?

23
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,240
Something that should never have happened.

24
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:39,900
But it did happen.

25
00:02:40,419 --> 00:02:42,060
And it's etched in my heart.

26
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:47,180
Afraid of me?

27
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,800
Or afraid you...

28
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,879
want it again, too?

29
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,840
Shen Mo.

30
00:03:03,539 --> 00:03:04,539
What?

31
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:07,039
Before the guesthouse,

32
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:09,159
we'd already

33
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,439
had a...

34
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,500
chance encounter.

35
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:24,680
I've decided. I'll pursue him.

36
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,400
He's the one you like?

37
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:34,000
That guy

38
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,919
is more intoxicating than alcohol.

39
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:40,199
One taste and you're hooked.

40
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:50,620
The moment we met, I knew.

41
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,080
I couldn't quit him.

42
00:03:52,659 --> 00:03:53,659
Cheng Yuze.

43
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:56,719
Are you serious?

44
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:04,300
Even if it's playing with fire,

45
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,240
and I get burned,

46
00:04:07,379 --> 00:04:08,579
I'm willing to take that risk.

47
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:17,180
OK.

48
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,959
If you're in love, go all in.

49
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:24,839
If it all falls apart,

50
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,240
I'll have your back.

51
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:39,879
By the way,

52
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,879
Jin Yumo will be back home.

53
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,400
If you don't make a move now,

54
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,879
you'll lose your chance.

55
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,320
She's got so much going for her.

56
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,680
Her suitors could line
up all the way to France.

57
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:50,879
Mind your own business.

58
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,160
I'll watch a movie tonight.

59
00:04:55,239 --> 00:04:56,239
I'll stay over.

60
00:04:56,323 --> 00:04:57,916
[They're watching "Casablanca"]

61
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:08,279
What's that noise?

62
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:10,839
You should head back.

63
00:05:12,019 --> 00:05:13,019
Brother.

64
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,100
No, wait...

65
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,519
Is this really my brother?

66
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,920
Damn. Me too...

67
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,898
Pet Code, Rule Seven:

68
00:06:50,899 --> 00:06:52,699
No staying up past 11 p.m.

69
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:49,060
I'm...

70
00:07:49,819 --> 00:07:50,819
I'm sorry.

71
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,199
It's OK.

72
00:08:38,476 --> 00:08:39,643
[Countdown: 19 days]

73
00:08:42,516 --> 00:08:44,109
[18 days]

74
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:50,210
[17 days]

75
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,080
Did you bring these?

76
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:03,320
Is that OK?

77
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:05,379
Left over from my shift at the flower shop.

78
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,080
It seemed a shame to throw them away.

79
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:08,359
And I think

80
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,240
they'll bring a little life to the place.

81
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:13,103
Go change your clothes and wash them.

82
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:14,659
Throw those flowers away.

83
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,440
I don't like the smell of flowers.

84
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,433
[It's expired.
You can't drink it.]

85
00:09:36,299 --> 00:09:37,878
That milk really is expired.

86
00:09:37,879 --> 00:09:38,879
Got it.

87
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,480
15 days left.

88
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:48,559
It will rain today.

89
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:08,960
It's broken.

90
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:11,159
It's not.

91
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,320
It's broken.

92
00:10:36,610 --> 00:10:38,050
[Cheng Law Practice]

93
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,259
Cheng Yu'an.

94
00:10:41,260 --> 00:10:42,499
Nice little trick.

95
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:44,519
Where did you dig up that evidence?

96
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:46,359
Half my life's hard work,

97
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,200
and you ruined it all!

98
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,200
What's the meaning of this?

99
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:52,199
Courts care about evidence,

100
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,200
not how hard you worked.

101
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,160
You falsified your copyright registration.

102
00:10:55,559 --> 00:10:56,979
That's your own problem.

103
00:10:56,980 --> 00:10:58,380
Spare me the fucking legal lecture!

104
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,600
Cheng Yu'an.

105
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:00,960
Playing that dirty,

106
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,320
aren't you afraid of karma?

107
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:03,679
Fuck.

108
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,519
Watch your mouth.

109
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:07,620
Throwing a fit because you lost the case?

110
00:11:08,179 --> 00:11:09,179
Get the hell out.

111
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,039
Cheng Yu'an.

112
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:15,159
Actually, I came here today

113
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:17,240
for more than that damn contract.

114
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,638
I heard

115
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:21,000
you're investigating Lin Yuanshan.

116
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:23,559
Lin Yuanshan's sketches,
unpublished when he died,

117
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:25,179
or

118
00:11:25,359 --> 00:11:27,878
the whereabouts of his missing son.

119
00:11:28,559 --> 00:11:29,960
Give me either one,

120
00:11:30,399 --> 00:11:31,639
and we'll call it even.

121
00:11:39,059 --> 00:11:40,240
Not a chance.

122
00:11:43,433 --> 00:11:45,313
If you want to fucking play dirty,

123
00:11:45,659 --> 00:11:47,220
give it all you've got.

124
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,440
Just you wait.

125
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:55,340
Fuck.

126
00:12:05,659 --> 00:12:06,399
Behave.

127
00:12:06,539 --> 00:12:08,419
Once you're connected, don't disconnect.

128
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:38,279
Asleep?

129
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:40,519
So well-behaved.

130
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:38,139
Your breathing sounds off.

131
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:39,759
You're breathing so fast.

132
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,080
You're burning up.

133
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,480
A fever, all of a sudden?

134
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,679
Did you get caught in the rain?

135
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,620
The umbrellas are by the door.

136
00:14:45,279 --> 00:14:46,860
You must have gone out without one.

137
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:50,700
Don't you know how to look after yourself?

138
00:15:29,139 --> 00:15:31,899
You stayed here all night?

139
00:15:32,899 --> 00:15:33,860
You're awake.

140
00:15:33,861 --> 00:15:36,100
Anything else bothering you?

141
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,299
Who let you in?

142
00:15:42,879 --> 00:15:44,320
I just...

143
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,500
heard you weren't feeling well yesterday.

144
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:48,019
I knocked, but you didn't answer.

145
00:15:48,279 --> 00:15:50,000
The Pet Code says:

146
00:15:51,179 --> 00:15:52,779
Without permission,

147
00:15:52,899 --> 00:15:55,419
you must not enter your
master's private space.

148
00:15:55,740 --> 00:15:57,379
The bedroom is strictly off-limits.

149
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,918
Without permission,

150
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:02,138
you must not enter your master's bedroom.

151
00:16:02,139 --> 00:16:03,378
Never get on the bed.

152
00:16:03,379 --> 00:16:04,700
Never stay overnight.

153
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:08,100
Good. You know the rules.

154
00:16:10,580 --> 00:16:11,620
Don't let it happen again.

155
00:16:23,039 --> 00:16:24,039
Dr. Shen.

156
00:16:24,259 --> 00:16:27,515
Taking over Cheng Yuze's psychological
counseling won't be a problem, will it?

157
00:16:27,539 --> 00:16:28,620
No problem, Chairman Cheng.

158
00:16:29,799 --> 00:16:31,799
He's been rebellious since childhood.

159
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:34,980
I want more than just appearances.

160
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:39,740
Keep an eye on him.

161
00:16:40,019 --> 00:16:41,299
Don't let him out of your sight.

162
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:43,059
Especially those around him.

163
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:45,219
If anything seems off,

164
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:46,740
I want to know right away.

165
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:49,220
Understood.

166
00:16:51,299 --> 00:16:52,860
If, in the future,

167
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:55,019
he's still the same as before,

168
00:16:55,299 --> 00:16:56,279
ungrateful

169
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,379
and self-destructive,

170
00:16:58,340 --> 00:16:59,638
send him away.

171
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:00,919
As far away as possible.

172
00:17:01,299 --> 00:17:02,500
Out of sight, out of mind.

173
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:06,838
A boarding school abroad,

174
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,079
or a correctional institution.

175
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,220
As long as

176
00:17:10,420 --> 00:17:12,019
he stays out of my sight.

177
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,420
Whatever my dad says,

178
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:14,720
just agree to it.

179
00:17:15,019 --> 00:17:16,019
Just do me this favor.

180
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:19,580
No problem, Chairman Cheng.

181
00:17:19,819 --> 00:17:20,960
I'll arrange it if needed.

182
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,599
OK.

183
00:17:32,619 --> 00:17:34,920
[Cheng Yuze] Shen Mo. Did you miss me?

184
00:17:48,223 --> 00:17:49,603
[Shanghai pop music broadcast]

185
00:18:44,339 --> 00:18:45,400
It lit up again.

186
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,440
As for Lin Yuanshan,

187
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,259
get all his unpublished sketches

188
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:10,720
back to me within a week.

189
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:00,719
The last song:

190
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,720
"Caged Beast."

191
00:20:27,019 --> 00:20:28,019
You're back.

192
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:18,759
The Pet Code says I mustn't touch it.

193
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,559
But if I fix it,

194
00:21:20,579 --> 00:21:22,359
he'll reward me, right?

195
00:21:57,819 --> 00:21:59,079
What is he doing?

196
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,799
Why is it so quiet?

197
00:22:06,940 --> 00:22:08,200
Breathing...

198
00:22:08,819 --> 00:22:10,460
His breathing... so close.

199
00:23:06,180 --> 00:23:07,900
(Next Episode)
Did Dad tell you to watch me,

200
00:23:08,285 --> 00:23:09,726
or did you want to come yourself?

201
00:23:09,900 --> 00:23:10,900
Done asking?

202
00:23:11,660 --> 00:23:12,660
Not yet.

203
00:23:24,740 --> 00:23:26,220
What does the Pet Code say?

204
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,240
Can we make an exception tonight?

205
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,680
Don't go.

206
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:38,680
Don't go.
